{"title":"1959 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A farmer divides his herd of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> cows among his four sons so that one son gets one-half the herd, a second son, one-fourth, a third son, one-fifth, and the fourth son, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cows. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a46717f1303a99d01dbbacb6e800495eec8556.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 100\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 140\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 180\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 240$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three sons get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/1/8a1127a92bcd374d5ad1233eebcc07cfc5c96026.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{5}=\\frac{19}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"128\" height=\"38\" /> of the herd, so that the fourth son should get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e19c4697dd55656f6c93e36ec31050657a592d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{20}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"20\" height=\"37\" /> of it. But the fourth son gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cows, so the size of the herd is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/845ffaf09ec9adb1349ac69141765c5e1aecba02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=\\frac{7}{\\frac{1}{20}} = 140$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"110\" height=\"45\" />. Then our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/1/6a1a5b835afeb8ce8c5c0be17da86297de027189.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(C) }140}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"73\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME\" title=\"1959 AHSME\">1959 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1959 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1959_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1959 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&a